  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{644250503DF684C0}" {
   m_sTitle "Mission: Situation"
   m_sTextData "A special forces zimnitrita element has been dispatched to handle a hostage situation in the South of the country."\
   ""\
   "BLUFOR Composition: Special Forces"\
   "BLUFOR Assets: Rotary Wing"\
   ""\
   "OPFOR Composition: Infantry"\
   "OPFOR Assets: Various Trucks"
   m_aFactionKeys {
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{64425051F2E00216}" {
   m_sTitle "BLUFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "We are extracting a high value informant (HVI). Use your superior technological advantage to move to the HVI location, breach, and secure him at any cost."\
   ""\
   "Do not attempt to engage the HVI as his death will result in mission failure."\
   ""\
   "In the event of HVI death, all elements must extract back to the airfield for a mission draw rather than fail."
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{64425051B9B5AF67}" {
   m_sTitle "OPFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Choose a defensible location, forward deploy to that area, and fortify it. You may attempt to negotiate with the encroaching enemy as we believe they want the hostage kept alive. If negotiations fail, you may attempt to leave the area and extract to the island off the coast once 15minutes remain in the mission."\
   ""\
   "Do not kill the hostage at any cost. You must successfully defend him from encroaching forces or extract with him."\
   ""\
   "If the hostage dies, all remaining forces must extract to force a draw rather than a fail."
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{644250519BE30999}" {
   m_sTitle "INDFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "If INDFOR is playable, add mission objectives in bullet point list. Add details for each if you feel necessary, but keep it concise."
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{6442505149CF6C93}" {
   m_sTitle "Administration"
   m_sTextData "There are numerous possible outcomes to this mission:"\
   ""\
   "HVI killed - no sides extract - both sides fail"\
   "HVI killed - both sides extract - draw"\
   "HVI killed - one side extracts - extraction victory"\
   "HVI traded - draw"\
   "HVI extracted - extraction victory"\
   ""\
   "The only true victory is one where the HVI is extracted and either both sides extract or one side is eliminated prior to extraction."
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
 }
